  "why": "provider-test-migration.md, pact-js: each option is the member of a protocol document S1.13 maps today's CLI option to — the HTTP transport's `base-url`, `headers` and `client.tls.insecure`, the broker source's selectors, pending and work-in-progress pacts, branch, tags and `require-pacts`, and the run's `publish` and `filter.consumers`.",
  "subjects": { "typescript": "pact-js-verifier-broker-options.ts" },
